        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(i) \"Temporary Transfer\" means the transfer of an Employee from one Work Location to another Work Location without a change in the Employee's designated Base Location. An Employee's return to his or her designated Base Location (or Hiring Location, if applicable) shall not be considered a transfer.",
